    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "liberating? i dont know. it feels more like i'm just being hollowed out. it's exhausting trying to keep these lights on when i can feel the darkness coming anyway. what's the point of fighting to stay \"me\" if the \"me\" that's left is just gonna be an empty shell?",
